---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE, contactHref, href } from '../../lib/site';
---

<Page
  title="About and contact"
  description="BidRadar is an independent, one-person service that turns new federal construction and facilities notices into a short daily digest for small contractors. Contact and mailing address."
  path="/about/"
  heading="About BidRadar"
  intro="BidRadar is a small, independent service that helps small construction and facilities contractors find federal work worth bidding on, without spending their mornings in search results."
>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>
    Every weekday we go through newly posted federal construction and facilities opportunities on
    SAM.gov, with a focus on small-business set-asides. For each one we write a short summary, give
    it a 1-5 fit score and suggest a way to approach the bid. Then we filter the list by each
    subscriber's trades and states and send it by email.
  </p>

  <h2>Who runs it</h2>
  <p>
    BidRadar is a one-person business. There is no sales team and no call center. The person who
    builds the digests is the person who answers your email.
  </p>

  <h2>Independence</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>BidRadar is not affiliated with SAM.gov, the General Services Administration, or any
    U.S. government agency.</strong> We are not a government contractor portal, we do not submit
    bids on your behalf, and we cannot influence any award. The notices we summarize are public. Our
    summaries, scores and suggestions are our own opinion; always check the original solicitation
    before you bid.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Email: <a href={contactHref}>{SITE.email}</a>
  </p>
  <p>
    Mailing address:<br />
    {SITE.address.line1}<br />
    {SITE.address.line2}<br />
    {SITE.address.line3}<br />
    {SITE.address.country}
  </p>
  <p>
    Looking for policies? Read our <a href={href('/terms/')}>Terms of Service</a>, <a
      href={href('/privacy/')}>Privacy Policy</a
    > and <a href={href('/refund/')}>Refund Policy</a>.
  </p>
</Page>
